Patched fork of golang.org/x/tools @ v0.0.0-20190524140312-2c0ae7006135
(the dep-era pin, May 2019).

Only the packages imported by this repo are vendored here
(go/analysis + analysistest + checker + passes/inspect,
go/ast/{astutil,inspector}, go/buildutil, go/{packages,
gcexportdata,internal/{gcimporter,packagesdriver}},
container/intsets, internal/{fastwalk,gopathwalk,semver}).

Patch vs upstream (1 functional line + comment):
go/packages no longer asserts the sizes result to *types.StdSizes
(go1.26's types.SizesFor returns *types.gcSizes, so the assertion
yielded nil and every type-check panicked on Sizes.Sizeof).
driverResponse.Sizes is now types.Sizes, assigned directly.

Wired via `replace golang.org/x/tools => ./third_party/x-tools`
in the root go.mod. Do not extend this fork; if the repo ever
moves to a newer x/tools, delete this directory and drop the
replace.
